<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 9.5 percent in the week ended October 25, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 8.6 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 9.8 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 2.2 percent to 309.4 from 316.4 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 0.4 percent to 178.4 in the latest survey from 179.2 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
